/*!
 * @example torque-reference.cxx
 *
 * @par [en] Below base speed: two reference policies, two current PIs, one feedforward, and where the ceiling goes. [zh] 基速以下：两个参考策略、两个电流 PI、一个前馈，以及天花板该放在哪。
 * @section torque_reference_shows [en] What the example shows [zh] 这个例子展示了什么
 * @par [en] One salient machine named once, asked the same q-axis command by two reference policies. On a salient
 *      machine the MTPA policy answers with a negative d current and the plain policy answers zero; on a surface
 *      machine the two answers coincide, which is why the policy is a template parameter and not a constant.
 * @par [zh] 一台凸极机只写一次，两个参考策略被问同一个 q 轴给定。凸极机上 MTPA 策略给出负的 d 轴电流、朴素策略给零；
 *      表贴机上两个答案重合——这正是"参考策略是模板参数而不是一个常数"的原因。
 *
 * @section torque_reference_allowance [en] The one field that turns MTPA off [zh] 让 MTPA 失效的那一个字段
 * @par [en] `i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad` defaults to zero, and zero refuses d current outright. The example builds the
 *      policy twice to show that: left at the default it answers exactly what the d=0 policy answers, and the reason is
 *      stated in the field's own documentation -- a d current is only safe once somebody has said how the angle is
 *      measured.
 * @par [zh] `i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad` 默认是零，而零就是完全不施加 d 轴电流。例子把策略建了两次正是为了展示这一点：
 *      留在默认值时它给出的答案与 d=0 策略完全相同，而原因写在该字段自己的文档里——只有在"角度怎么测"有交代之后，
 *      d 轴电流才是安全的。
 *
 * @section torque_reference_ceiling [en] Where the voltage ceiling belongs [zh] 电压天花板该放在哪
 * @par [en] After the feedforward, not inside the PI: the PI's own clamp is what stops the integral from winding up,
 *      and the sum of PI and feedforward is what the modulator has to be able to deliver. The example clamps the sum
 *      and prints both, so the reader can see the difference rather than take it on trust.
 * @par [zh] 放在前馈 **之后** 、PI 之内不放：PI 自己的限幅是用来阻止积分饱和的，而"PI 加前馈"之和才是调制器要能给出的量。
 *      例子夹的是和，并且把两者都打印出来，读者可以自己看出差别，而不必相信这句话。
 *
 * @section torque_reference_not [en] What the example deliberately does not do [zh] 例子故意不做的事
 * @par [en] No plant and no torque. A torque number computed here would be a second implementation of a law that
 *      already has one, so the example stops at the current reference and the voltage command. Closed-loop torque is
 *      what the SIL bench measures, and it is a claim row with a case behind it.
 * @par [zh] 没有被控对象，也不算转矩。在这里算一个转矩数会是某条已有实现的律的第二份实现，所以例子止步于电流参考与
 *      电压指令。闭环转矩由 SIL 台架测量，它是一条带用例的 claim 行。
 *
 * @section torque_reference_numbers [en] The numbers behind the figure [zh] 图背后的数字
 * @par [en] Printed by the example itself on one salient machine (`lq = 2 * ld`): the `d = 0`
 *      column is the plain policy, `mtpa(0)` is MTPA left at its default (which refuses d current
 *      outright), `mtpa(allow)` is the same policy once a d-current budget is written down.
 *
 * | iq command (A) | mtpa(0) id (A) | mtpa(allow) id (A) | d = 0 id (A) | iq (A) |
 * |---|---|---|---|---|
 * | 0.50 | -0.0000 | -0.0100 | 0.0000 | 0.5000 |
 * | 1.50 | -0.0000 | -0.0894 | 0.0000 | 1.5000 |
 * | 3.00 | -0.0000 | -0.3457 | 0.0000 | 2.9800 |
 *
 * @par [zh] 由示例自己在一台凸极机（`lq = 2 * ld`）上打印：`d = 0` 列是朴素策略，`mtpa(0)` 是留在默认值的 MTPA 策略（完全不施加 d 轴电流），`mtpa(allow)` 是写明 d 轴电流预算之后的同一策略。
 *
 * | iq 给定 (A) | mtpa(0) 的 id (A) | mtpa(allow) 的 id (A) | d = 0 的 id (A) | iq (A) |
 * |---|---|---|---|---|
 * | 0.50 | -0.0000 | -0.0100 | 0.0000 | 0.5000 |
 * | 1.50 | -0.0000 | -0.0894 | 0.0000 | 1.5000 |
 * | 3.00 | -0.0000 | -0.3457 | 0.0000 | 2.9800 |
 *
 * @include torque-reference.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; the command on the first line of the example links the two
 *            translation units it needs directly, which is enough for a demo and not what a product should do.
 * @note [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；例子第一行给出的命令直接链了它需要的两个翻译单元，对演示够用，但不是产品该用的方式。
 *
 * @since 0.1.0
 */
